    "why": "Owner decision O carries the department's weeks in the context with CLIPPED bounds, computed server-side by Calendar::weeksIn(), and the clipping only ever matters at a block edge — which is exactly where a scheduler cannot check the arithmetic by eye. This block ends on the 26th, so its last week runs 23rd to 26th and not to the 29th. p-ali holds two duties inside the clipped week and two more on the 27th and 28th, which are in the raw week and in the NEXT block: under the clipped bounds that is two and clean, under the raw bounds four and flagged. p-noor's three inside the clipped range are what stops the case being green because nothing was counted at all.",
